  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It removes mixed aura in the aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "That effect cleanses aperture walls and flushes external energies so the sequela of foreign essence can be cleared.",
        "chapters": [
          50
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It completely washes away impurities in the aperture, and it is the most common method for clearing the black-red residue left by Man-beast Life Burial Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          152
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_man_beast_burial_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Tie Ruo Nan later states that it has only one use: cleansing foreign primeval essence auras from the aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          179
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_ruo_nan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During the wolf-tide stretch Fang Yuan forces Chi Lian to hand the Gu over, framing the transfer as a loan with a signed receipt, and leaves the Chi manor with the Gu plus three thousand primeval stones.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "By chapter 159 that Gu has already been used. The black-red Man-beast Life Burial Gu residue in his aperture is gone, and he notes that without the cleansing his aptitude would have fallen further than the drop he already took.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
