  "economy": {
    "canonical_prices": [],
    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is again the cure for mixed aura after an elder imparts primeval essence, and it is a rare Gu that ordinary Gu Masters struggle to obtain. Even elders must rely on luck or pay a tremendous price.",
        "chapters": [
          226
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ],
        "needs_review": true
      },
      {
        "text": "After the Liquor worm leaves the central counter of Jia Fu’s caravan treehouse, a Cleansing Water Gu takes that place. Fang Yuan judges that Chi Lian will buy it for Chi Cheng, estimates Chi Lian’s quote at about six hundred thirty to six hundred forty primeval stones, and judges that six hundred fifty would win it. He does not bid.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sale-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_liquor_worm",
          "char_jia_fu",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The treehouse specimen is later bought by the Chi faction.",
        "chapters": [
          152
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sale-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_chi_family"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Chi Lian did buy that Gu and held it for Chi Cheng.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sale-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Jia Fu’s intel to the Tie investigators also records when and at what price Chi Lian bought it, though that chapter does not quote the number in the narration.",
        "chapters": [
          179
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sale-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
